qcnpuperf (1.0-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Initial Debian packaging.
  * Add qcnpuperfd: daemon polling NPU/DSP metrics every 500 ms via FastRPC.
    Metrics written atomically to /dev/shm/qcnpuperf; no history retained.
  * Includes libqcnpuperf shared library, qcom_dsp.h header, and pkg-config file.

